diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 7765fed..9aeaaee 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -67,6 +67,10 @@ Allow people to move between OSS and SAAS Fizzy instances:
 - Must be able to handle very large ZIP files (500+GB)
 - Models in `app/models/account/data_transfer/`, `app/models/zip_file`
 
+### Languages
+
+Fizzy speaks English (the default) and Japanese. `?locale=ja` on any page switches a person's language; `CurrentLocale` remembers it in the session and on their `Identity`, and mailers, push notifications and per-user broadcasts run in the recipient's language via `in_locale`. Views use lazy `t(".key")` lookups with translations organized by area under `config/locales/`. Static error pages in `public/` are bilingual since they're served without knowing who is looking.
+
 ## Coding style
 
 Before editing or reviewing code, read STYLE.md.
